<!DOCTYPE suzuki [
<!ENTITY % sdatacharaents SYSTEM "..\config8\sdatacharaents.txt">
%sdatacharaents;
]>
<suzuki><manual>
<section sectnbr = "1D">
<servcat sctnbr = "01" scnbr = "04">
<configtype typenbr = "1">
<servinfotype sitcode = "6">
<servinfo servinfosgmlid = "AENLSB0A1416025" svcinfotypenbr = "08" svcinfoqualnbr = "01" page = "2" supplyoff = "1" modify = "0">
<title>
Engine Assembly Removal and Installation
</title>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1416025001">
<title>
Removal
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Relieve fuel pressure. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1716003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect steering lower shaft from pinion shaft. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A6206019"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove battery and battery tray. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1A16002"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect ECM connectors and related clamps. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1316001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Hoist vehicle and remove engine undercover and engine under side covers.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drain the following oils.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Engine oil: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1516001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Manual transaxle oil (M/T model): 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5206002"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
ATF (A/T model): 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5106005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Drain coolant. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1616004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove air cleaner assembly, resonator and air cleaner suction hose No.2. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1416004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
For M/T model, disconnect clutch fluid pipe from clutch pipe joint. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5306009"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect the following cables.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
M/T model: Gear shift and select control cables 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5206005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
A/T model: Select cable 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5106015"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect the following connectors and cable including the related clamps.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Connectors (1) in main fuse box
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Connector (2) in individual circuit fuse box No.1
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Battery ground cable (3)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Electric load current sensor connector (4)
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A144049.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "64.013mm" ver = "01" gw = "224" gh = "165"/>
</figure>
</item>
</list1>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect the following hoses.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Vacuum hose (1)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Fuel feed hose (2)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
EVAP canister purge valve hose (3)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Heater inlet hose (4)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Heater outlet hose (5)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Air cleaner suction hose No.1 (6)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Radiator inlet hose (7)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Intercooler outlet hose No.2 (8)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Radiator outlet hose (9)
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Turbocharger water outlet hose (10)
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove intercooler inlet hose (11).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A144050.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "50.619mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "127"/>
</figure>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A144051.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "50.619mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "127"/>
</figure>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A144052.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "50.619mm" ver = "01" gw = "206" gh = "127"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
With hoses connected, detach A/C compressor from cylinder block, and disconnect magnet clutch lead wire connector. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A7206043"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
When A/C compressor is detached, the A/C hoses could be damaged receiving weight of the compressor.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Suspend the removed A/C compressor to the vehicle body while the compressor is detached.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove stabilizer bar joints from stabilizer bar. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A2206012"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect tie-rod end from steering knuckle at each of right and left sides. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A6206022"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect suspension arm joint from steering knuckle at each of right and left sides. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A2206008"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect right and left drive shaft joints from steering knuckle. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A3116003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove exhaust pipe and center pipe. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1B16004"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Support front suspension frame (1), transaxle case (2) and oil pan (3) using jack.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove front suspension frame bolts (4).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A144053.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "62.919mm" ver = "01" gw = "231" gh = "162"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove engine right mounting bolt (1) and nuts (2).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A144054.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "52.990mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "134"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove engine left mounting bolt (1) and nuts (2).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A144055.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.159mm" ver = "01" gw = "200" gh = "134"/>
</figure>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A144056.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.336mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "135"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<colspec colnum = "3" colname = "3" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "4" colname = "4" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[A]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
M/T model
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[B]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
A/T model
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Before removing engine, check that all hoses, electric wires and cables are disconnected from engine.
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Lower engine assembly with transaxle, front suspension frame, drive shafts, steering gear case all together.
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
The A/C compressor may be damaged if it hits against or interferes with other parts.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Suspend the removed A/C compressor in a place where no damage will be caused during removal of the engine assembly.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove air cleaner suction pipe No.2 (1).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Disconnect connector from boost pressure sensor with IAT sensor-2 (2).
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove intercooler outlet pipe No.2 (3).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A144057.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.159mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "134"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
For LHD, remove engine harness bracket (1).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A144058.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "54.514mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "138"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install a suitable hook (1) with bolt and nut as shown in figure and lift engine, if necessary, with transaxle and suspension frame assembled, using this hook and another hook (2) on transaxle.
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFAE0A140063.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "58.689mm" ver = "01" gw = "216" gh = "150"/>
</figure>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A144059.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "38.202mm" ver = "01" gw = "230" gh = "92"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<colspec colnum = "3" colname = "3" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "4" colname = "4" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[A]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
M/T model
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[B]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
A/T model
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove front drive shaft assemblies, if necessary. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A3116003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove front suspension frame, if necessary. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A2206013"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install a suitable hook (1) with bolt and nut on chain cover, and special tool (engine hook) on cylinder head (2) as shown, and then using these hooks lift engine assembly.
</ptxt>
<servicetool>
<servicetoolitem id = "L1D114">
<s-part>
(A)
</s-part>
<s-number num = "09910-66810">
09910–66810
</s-number>
</servicetoolitem>
</servicetool>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IFAE0A140063.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "58.689mm" ver = "01" gw = "216" gh = "150"/>
</figure>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGAA0A142005.swf" width = "88.000mm" height = "58.499mm" ver = "01" gw = "216" gh = "149"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Remove the following components from engine assembly, if necessary.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Engine harness
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Transaxle
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
M/T model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5206012"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
A/T model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5106029"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Clutch cover and disc (M/T model): 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5306018"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Flywheel (M/T model): 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1416030"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Drive plate (A/T model): 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1416030"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</s1>
</servinfosub>
<servinfosub id = "AENLSB0A1416025002">
<title>
Installation
</title>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install the following components to engine, if removed.
</ptxt>
<list1 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
Flywheel (M/T model): 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1416030"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Drive plate (A/T model): 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1416030"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Clutch disc and cover (M/T model): 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5306018"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
Transaxle
</ptxt>
</item>
<list2 type = "unordered">
<item>
<ptxt>
M/T model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5206012"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
<item>
<ptxt>
A/T model: 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A5106029"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</item>
</list2>
<item>
<ptxt>
Engine harness
</ptxt>
</item>
</list1>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Positioning ground cable to specified angle as shown, tighten engine harness ground bolt (1) to specified torque, if removed.
</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>
Position range for ground cable
</title>
<ptxt>
“a”: 22.5&#176;
</ptxt>
</spec>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1D110">
<t-part>
Engine harness ground bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
11
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
1.1
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
8.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IGSB0A142029.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "54.890mm" ver = "01" gw = "230" gh = "139"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install front suspension frame, if removed. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A2206013"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install front drive shaft assemblies, if removed. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A3116003"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
For LHD, install engine cover bracket No.1 (1).
</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A144058.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "54.514mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "138"/>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install intercooler outlet pipe No.2. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1416005"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Install air cleaner suction pipe No.2. 
<intxreftitleoff1 refid = "AENLSB0A1416001"><img src = "..\icon\intxreftitleoff.gif"/></intxreftitleoff1>
</ptxt>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Lift up engine assembly with transaxle, front suspension frame, drive shafts and P/S gear case all together.
</ptxt>
<attention4>
<ptxt>
The A/C compressor may be damaged if it hits against or interferes with other parts.
</ptxt>
<ptxt>
Suspend the removed A/C compressor in a place where no damage will be caused during installation of the engine assembly.
</ptxt>
</attention4>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Tighten engine left mounting nuts (1) and bolt (2) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
<torqueitem id = "T1D111">
<t-part>
Engine left mounting nut
</t-part>
<t-part1>
a
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
55
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
5.6
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
40.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
<torqueitem id = "T1D112">
<t-part>
Engine left mounting bolt
</t-part>
<t-part1>
b
</t-part1>
<t-value1>
55
</t-value1>
<t-value2>
5.6
</t-value2>
<t-value3>
40.5
</t-value3>
</torqueitem>
</torque>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A144060.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.159mm" ver = "01" gw = "200" gh = "134"/>
</figure>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname = "IHSB0A144061.jpg" width = "88.000mm" height = "53.336mm" ver = "01" gw = "199" gh = "135"/>
<callout>
<table frame = "all" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<tgroup cols = "4" colsep = "1" rowsep = "1">
<colspec colnum = "1" colname = "1" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "2" colname = "2" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<colspec colnum = "3" colname = "3" colwidth = "0.315in"/>
<colspec colnum = "4" colname = "4" colwidth = "1.378in"/>
<tbody>
<row rowsep = "0">
<entry colname = "1" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[A]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "2" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
M/T model
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "3" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "1" border-right = "0" align = "right">
<ptxt>
[B]:
</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry colname = "4" border-top = "1" border-bottom = "1" border-left = "0" border-right = "1" align = "left">
<ptxt>
A/T model
</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</callout>
</figure>
</s1>
<s1>
<ptxt>
Tighten new engine right mounting nuts (1) and new bolt (2) to specified torque.
</ptxt>
<torque>
